			"Message": "build(Common): Add path alias for TypeScript modules in tsconfig.json\n\nConfigure path aliases in tsconfig.json to resolve @Function/* imports from the TypeScript/Function directory. This enables cleaner module resolution within the Common crate's TypeScript code.\n\nThis change supports better organization of the module system and aligns with the project's path-based imports for improved developer experience and build consistency.",
